alse, "body": "こんにちは。私のオリジナルキャラクターを気に入ってくれてとても嬉しいです！私は彼女をあなたの好きなように描き、あなたの好きな作品を作らせています！さらに、彼女の好きなものはこの小さなカラフルなボール（https://imgur.com/a/0P5I1mi）です。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://ibb.co/g6hjH26", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lamy_it/works/58", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/13cc4401/uploads/origins/4533c00a-7818-47cb-82fa-9c39dd5d9fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c3fc3e53d7d829c89c500e025d21986", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/13cc4401/uploads/origins/4533c00a-7818-47cb-82fa-9c39dd5d9fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c3fc3e53d7d829c89c500e025d21986, https://si.imgix.net/13cc4401/uploads/origins/4533c00a-7818-47cb-82fa-9c39dd5d9fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1790630a700a7ace6c4b3bcf5f9859e3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/13cc4401/uploads/origins/4533c00a-7818-47cb-82fa-9c39dd5d9fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6c19b96ddf2a3a70a40b761d7fc183f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I would like my Miqo'te drawn!\n\nCharacter: https://imgur.com/a/OXmoKdz\nShe is a cat girl with blue eyes, pink hair with highlights and she has an angel wing hair clip.\nShe is very cheerful, kind, and cute.\n\nPlease draw her in any cute pose, I leave the composition and expression to you!\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/OXmoKdz", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lamy_it/works/57", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fdd72af/uploads/origins/dbc50127-c170-4486-ac4c-6c8bd3c8b712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d5542f7b271e64cb9d9d3e14257fb44", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fdd72af/uploads/origins/dbc50127-c170-4486-ac4c-6c8bd3c8b712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d5542f7b271e64cb9d9d3e14257fb44, https://si.imgix.ne